title: "Code for: One Talk Shifts Beliefs About Science Jobs but Not Detectably Gender Beliefs: A Randomized Role-Model Visit in a Colombian Technical High School"
abstract: "oTree 3.3.11 code of a field experiment with 210 eleventh-grade students in Chía, Colombia (September 2022): a 7-block gender-STEM Implicit Association Test followed by a 14-page survey. Adapted from WZB's otree_iat. Contains no participant data."
